WHY THIS NOTICE IS LONGER THAN THE REPOSITORY

There is no source code here. There are release assets: a `.dmg` per architecture and a
`SHA256SUMS.txt`. But this repository is how the built application is DISTRIBUTED, and Apache-2.0
section 4(d) attaches to distribution rather than to source. So the notices below pertain here, even
though nothing in this repository's git history contains the code they describe.

That is the opposite of the website's repository, whose NOTICE deliberately omits them: it publishes
pages, not the application, so a component bundled into the application does not pertain to it.


